[0.011, "o", "\u001b[?1049h\u001b[22;0;0t\u001b[1;30r\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4l\u001b[?7h\u001b[?1h\u001b="]
[0.004, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[2d\u001b(0\u001b[0mqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqq\u001b(B\u001b[6;1H\u001b(0\u001b[0m"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\"There ought not to be anything in the whole universe that man can't poke his nose into - that's the\u001b[7;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "way we're built and I assume that there's some reason for that.\"\u001b[9;6H"]
[0.000, "o", "- Robert Heinlein"]
[2.504, "o", "\r\u001b[4d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mRover's Day Out\r\u001b[5d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mAn Interactive Fiction by Jack Welch and Ben Collins-Sussman\r\u001b[6d"]
[0.000, "o", "Release 12 / Serial number 091116 / Inform 7 build 5Z71 (I6/v6.31 lib 6/12N)\u001b[K\r\u001b[7d"]
[0.000, "o", "Type \"help\" for instructions, credits, and license or just blaze on impetuously.\r\u001b[9d\u001b[K\u001b[10d"]
[0.000, "o", "Janet: David, are you hooked in?\r\u001b[11d"]
[0.000, "o", "David: Ready to go. Is this the final version of the ACU,\u001b[12;8Hor another beta?\r\u001b[13d"]
[0.000, "o", "Janet: A program is never finished, but I think we're ready\u001b[14;8H"]
[0.000, "o", "to go.\r\u001b[15d"]
[0.000, "o", "David: I hope so, Earth could launch any day now.\r\u001b[16dJanet: Run program.\r\u001b[18d"]
[2.507, "o", "\u001b[3;10r\u001b[3;1H\u001b[4T\u001b[1;30r\u001b[1;2H"]
[0.000, "o", "ACU -> INTERRUPT : TRUE\u001b[1;85H"]
[0.000, "o", "Memory: 508.5PB\u001b[6;16H"]
[0.000, "o", "*    *    *\u001b[9;16H"]
[0.000, "o", "Simulation by Janet Xiang\u001b[K\u001b[10;9H"]
[0.000, "o", "beta 732 / Serial number 23920401 / Inform 10.6 build Mu-013 (I6/v.7.1 lib 7/18N)\r\u001b[11d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[12d"]
[0.000, "o", "Rover draws pensively on his stubby cigar, the tip glowing red below his dealer's hat. He paws\r\u001b[13d"]
[0.000, "o", "nonchalantly at the scotch and water he has been nursing for the last half hour. Despite the tower\r\u001b[14d"]
[0.000, "o", "of chips in front of him, he's either in trouble now, or trying to play the rest of the table for\r\u001b[15d"]
[0.000, "o", "suckers. His tail is no longer wagging, though, and you suspect that the scotch may be getting the\r\u001b[16d"]
[0.000, "o", "better of him. He can't mass more than about 30 kilos, and he's been putting them away tonight. You\r\u001b[17dpush all in, figuring that even if you lose it all, at least you'll get some sleep before you need\r\u001b[18d"]
[0.000, "o", "to get back to the MARSpace. Elva the cleaning lady folds, as does Isaac Asimov and that boy that\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "you kissed in fourth grade. Wait...don't go....where is everyone going?\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "David: You have some weird dreams.\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "Janet: You can't hold me responsible for the subconscious\u001b[25;8H"]
[0.000, "o", "ramblings of the ACU.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "<beep> <beep> <beep>\r\u001b[29d>"]
[2.503, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1ml\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mo\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mo\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mk\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.095, "o", "\r\u001b[3d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[5M\u001b[H "]
[0.000, "o", "OPERATIONS -> STATUS : TRUE\u001b[93G"]
[0.000, "o", "484.6\r\u001b[25dAlarm clock. Next to bed. Make it stop.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "<beep> <beep> <beep>\r\u001b[29d>"]
