[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1my\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.095, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[5M\u001b[H "]
[0.000, "o", "ACU -> MANIFEST : TRUE     \u001b[95G"]
[0.000, "o", "5.1\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "You are carrying nothing, which is more often than not the case when you wake up most days.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.001, "o", "<beep> <beep> <beep>\r\u001b[29d>"]
[2.412, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mw\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1ma\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mk\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1me\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m \u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mu\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mp\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.096, "o", "\r\u001b[3d\u001b[8M\u001b[1;9H"]
[0.000, "o", "INITIALIZE : TRUE\u001b[94G"]
[0.000, "o", "91.9\r\u001b[22dGathering your resolve, you slowly slide off the side of the futon, inadvertently sending the alarm\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "clock on a death spiral off the edge of the futon. Oh well, you can find it later. Meanwhile, you\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "slowly stand up, recapitulating millions of years of evolution in a few seconds.\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "As you get out of bed, you notice that your left arm tickles a bit -- must have been the way you\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "were sleeping.\r\u001b[29d>"]
[2.412, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1ml\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
